---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Downloads｜J 的世界 Research">

<section class="page-hero">

  <div class="page-hero-inner">

    <div class="kicker">DOWNLOADS · RESEARCH LIBRARY</div>

    <h1>研究資料庫</h1>

    <p>
      集中整理 Research、研究海報與 PDF。
      未來將逐步建立《J 的世界 Research》的完整研究資料庫。
    </p>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">RESEARCH EDITION</div>
      <h2>Research Vol.01</h2>
    </div>

    <p>AI Platform Evolution · P1–P8</p>

  </div>


  <div class="library-card">

    <div>

      <span class="tag">VOL.01 · RESEARCH</span>

      <h3>AI Platform Evolution</h3>

      <p>
        從台積電 2026 China Technology Symposium 出發，
        拆解 AI Platform 從先進製程、先進封裝、
        光互連、材料到 AI Infrastructure 的演進。
      </p>

      <div class="edition-meta">

        <span>P1–P8</span>
        <span>Facts First</span>
        <span>Evidence-Based Research</span>

      </div>

    </div>


    <div class="edition-actions">

      <a class="button" href="/research">
        Read Research →
      </a>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/maps">
        Industry Maps
      </a>

      <a class="button-secondary" href="/posters">
        Posters
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="feature">

  <div class="section">

    <div class="section-head">

      <div>
        <div class="kicker">RESEARCH MATERIALS</div>
        <h2>研究資料</h2>
      </div>

      <p>Research Library</p>

    </div>


    <div class="grid">


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">RESEARCH</span>

        <h3>AI Platform Evolution</h3>

        <p>
          完整研究內容 P1–P8。
          從事件、證據、技術路徑一路延伸至
          Glass Core、AI Infrastructure 與 Future Watch。
        </p>

        <a class="button-secondary" href="/research">
          Open Research →
        </a>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">POSTERS</span>

        <h3>Industry Posters</h3>

        <p>
          將 AI、Glass Core 與 CPO 等研究內容
          濃縮成一頁式視覺化研究。
        </p>

        <a class="button-secondary" href="/posters">
          Open Posters →
        </a>

      </article>


      <article class="card">

        <span class="tag">INDUSTRY MAPS</span>

        <h3>Technology Maps</h3>

        <p>
          以技術節點、供應鏈位置與 Evidence Level
          建立 AI 產業鏈研究框架。
        </p>

        <a class="button-secondary" href="/maps">
          Open Maps →
        </a>

      </article>


    </div>

  </div>

</section>


<section class="section">

  <div class="section-head">

    <div>
      <div class="kicker">COMING NEXT</div>
      <h2>Research Editions</h2>
    </div>

  </div>


  <article class="card coming-card">

    <span class="tag">PDF LIBRARY</span>

    <h3>印刷級與數位版研究資料</h3>

    <p>
      後續將逐步加入研究 PDF、印刷級版本、
      數位閱讀版與相關研究附件。
    </p>

    <p class="muted">
      ※ 目前此區為 Research Library 架構，
      實際檔案將於完成製作後陸續上線。
    </p>

  </article>

</section>


<section class="cta">

  <div class="cta-inner">

    <div>

      <div class="kicker">BACK TO RESEARCH</div>

      <h2>從資料庫回到研究本身。</h2>

      <p>
        閱讀完整 Research Vol.01，
        或從 Industry Maps / Posters 進一步探索。
      </p>

    </div>

    <a class="button" href="/research">
      Read Research →
    </a>

  </div>

</section>


<style>

  .library-card {
    border: 1px solid #344457;
    background:
      linear-gradient(
        135deg,
        rgba(28, 42, 58, 0.95),
        rgba(14, 21, 30, 0.96)
      );
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 34px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .library-card h3 {
    font-size: 30px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }

  .library-card p {
    color: #aeb9c6;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .edition-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .edition-meta span {
    border: 1px solid #354457;
    border-radius: 7px;
    padding: 5px 9px;
    color: #b9c6d4;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  .edition-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    min-width: 160px;
  }

  .edition-actions .button-secondary {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .card .button-secondary {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  .coming-card {
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .muted {
    color: #7f8d9d !important;
    font-size: 12px;
  }

  @media(max-width:800px) {

    .library-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 26px;
      gap: 24px;
    }

    .library-card h3 {
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    .edition-actions {
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .edition-actions .button,
    .edition-actions .button-secondary {
      text-align: center;
    }

  }

</style>

</BaseLayout>
